{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118529","id":3524121622,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7SDdQW","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118529","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118529.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118529.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118529","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118529/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118529/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118529/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a8d1649ee701896914bc2edccc24572e72953567","number":118529,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add `OutputPanel` for in-game debugging","user":{"login":"boycher","id":274249743,"node_id":"U_kgDOEFi4Dw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274249743?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boycher","html_url":"https://github.com/boycher","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boycher/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boycher/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boycher/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boycher/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boycher/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boycher/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boycher/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boycher/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boycher/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14628\r\n\r\nThis PR adds a new control node called `OutputPanel` that captures and displays engine's log output directly inside a running game. Doing this manually is possible since 4.5 via [Custom Logger](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/scripting/logging.html#creating-custom-loggers) but it requires a lot of setup as compared to this built-in drag and drop solution. It supports all the print functions like `print()`, `print_rich()`, `push_error()`, `push_warning()` etc.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/af718055-041c-4bad-a249-576eba9c6de4\r\n\r\nIt includes basic properties like Max Lines, Filters (error, warning, standard message) and a Debug Only toggle which ensures that the panel is only visible and functional in debug builds.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"683\" height=\"658\" alt=\"Screenshot_20260413-220745_Godot Engine 4 (debug)\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6cfd84ab-5306-4186-addc-b5b88ebbdbc0\" />\r\n\r\nIt is fully customisable and includes theme overrides like error color, warning colour, standard message color, fonts and the background stylebox.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"684\" height=\"1021\" alt=\"Screenshot_20260413-220844_Godot Engine 4 (debug)\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0854a5c1-9f23-4e96-a1d9-d032ae10e55d\" />","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active